ash and cash equivalents and $695 million in short-term investments, and $3.2 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent + ShortTermBorrowings). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $496 million (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["LITE.cash.2026","LITE.sti.2026","LITE.debtLong.2026","LITE.debtCurrent.2026","LITE.debtShort.2026"]}]},"fin":{"LITE":{}},"quotes":{"LITE.q.employees":{"c":"LITE","kind":"employees","n":13757,"quote":"As of June 27, 2026, we employed approximately 13,757 full-time employees, including approximately 11,916 employees in manufacturing, 1,085 employees in R&D and 756 employees in SG&A.","source":"LITE-0001628280-26-057358","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"3faa549d5b567fd95339dd85589dcab3eaae562c9455130714f6e52ac07e26ce"}}}